{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Shadow of Ancients</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow of Ancients</strong> is a single-player, story-driven action RPG set in a stylized and colorful world where the elder ones vanished. You play as <strong>Aiden</strong>, a young adventurer who unknowingly carries a reincarnating Tuyuk (An Ancient demon) within him. As the player, you will experience his adventures, which are powerful, unpredictable, and not always in your control.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/d66c287f04958a8c1ac779d207bbde26.poster.avif?t=1773029357\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/d66c287f04958a8c1ac779d207bbde26.webm?t=1773029357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s in the Demo (First Public Build \u2013 October 18)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Act I slice</strong>: Early quests, exploration, and combat encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time combat:</strong> with dodges, skills, and light/heavy attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demon Mode with Boss fights:</strong> Aiden\u2019s power can possess him and <strong>you briefly lose control</strong>\u00a0and have to play the enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather &amp; craft</strong>: pick herbs and materials to brew survival potions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A stylized, nature-heavy world:</strong>\u00a0A world you can wander around in forest paths, ruins, and underground caves <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/263d6196ae8b1f10769cc5e83666920a.avif?t=1773029357\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features (Full Game Vision)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story First But... :</strong> This game is about Aiden's journey, but you, the Player, will decide and change his path and relations with the people, choices and what's lying beyond...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoyable and engaging combat:</strong>\u00a0Improved fight mechanics with leveling and skill sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved UI:</strong> Improved look and feel throughout the whole UI/UX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration with purpose</strong>: Even more meaningful, side quests, parkour, puzzles and chases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect, brew, survive</strong>: flora/fauna items feed a simple, useful crafting loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean, cel-shaded look:</strong>\u00a0We'll keep our look inspired by modern stylized RPGs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/958c0b6d6672f19493870274c3a02189.avif?t=1773029357\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why a Demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re releasing this early slice to learn from you. There\u2019s plenty to improve, balance, UI, onboarding, performance... and that\u2019s the point. We can see some of them, but we need a fresh perspective from your view!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/064a69c6330d66c948a6bac1fb0588da.poster.avif?t=1773029357\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/064a69c6330d66c948a6bac1fb0588da.webm?t=1773029357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please tell us:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What confused you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What did you feel in combat? What would you want to feel?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which quests or areas pulled you in or didn\u2019t?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Steam Discussions</strong> or any in-game/launcher feedback link we (hopefully) provide. Write us from our Reddit or Linkedin, wherever you can contact us, we'll be happy to receive your feedback! Bug reports, wish-list ideas, \u201cI expected <u>this</u> but <u>that</u> happened\u201d all of it helps shape the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/43773b64b2310740cd97335fd904d765.poster.avif?t=1773029357\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/43773b64b2310740cd97335fd904d765.webm?t=1773029357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect tuning and content gaps in the demo (placeholder UI/text, performance spikes on some rigs).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll iterate based on your feedback and share changes in the update posts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks for playing our first public demo.</strong> If you like where it\u2019s headed, <strong>Wishlist &amp; Follow</strong>\u2014it genuinely helps a small team like ours. We check our wishlists almost daily and you encourage us to do so!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/5b233e7fc9cd20a023207d384c32091b.poster.avif?t=1773029357\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/5b233e7fc9cd20a023207d384c32091b.webm?t=1773029357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273380?t=1773029357","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273380?t=1773029357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/2977a493244e972662313fbdd3f5b908d8855330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773029357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/2977a493244e972662313fbdd3f5b908d8855330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773029357","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The world of Shadow of Ancients offers a world of bloody warfare, albeit a little"},"demos":[{"appid":3988840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Shadow of Ancients</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow of Ancients</strong> is a single-player, story-driven action RPG set in a stylized and colorful world where the elder ones vanished. You play as <strong>Aiden</strong>, a young adventurer who unknowingly carries a reincarnating Tuyuk (An Ancient demon) within him. As the player, you will experience his adventures, which are powerful, unpredictable, and not always in your control.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p