:</strong>\u00a0Improved fight mechanics with leveling and skill sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved UI:</strong> Improved look and feel throughout the whole UI/UX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration with purpose</strong>: Even more meaningful, side quests, parkour, puzzles and chases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect, brew, survive</strong>: flora/fauna items feed a simple, useful crafting loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean, cel-shaded look:</strong>\u00a0We'll keep our look inspired by modern stylized RPGs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/958c0b6d6672f19493870274c3a02189.avif?t=1773029357\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why a Demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re releasing this early slice to learn from you. There\u2019s plenty to improve, balance, UI, onboarding, performance... and that\u2019s the point. We can see some of them, but we need a fresh perspective from your view!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/064a69c6330d66c948a6bac1fb0588da.poster.avif?t=1773029357\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273380/extras/064a69c6330d66c948a6bac1fb0588da.webm?t=1773029357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please tell us:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What confused you?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What did you feel in combat? What would you want to feel?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which quests or areas pulled you in or